    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n26616" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">διεξ-ίημι</span></b> , strengthd. for <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐξίημι,</span>
